      "artist": "Tsdinos",
      "description": "Wreck of the 965 GRT coaster MV Cornelia on Valtaki beach, near Gytheio, Greece. Frederikshavns Vaerft &amp; Flydedok in Denmark built her in 1950, launching her as Klintholm for DFDS. In 1966 she was bought by Greek owners in Piraeus who renamed her Dimitrios. She changed owners in 1974 and 1976, keeping the same name. In 1979 Anepap Ltd of Piraeus bought her and renamed her Cornelia. Anepap Ltd abandoned her in Gytheio, where in about 1980 the harbour authority towed her out of port and anchored her offshore. On 23 December 1981 she ran aground after dragging her anchor.",
